      "name": "iris-cdn-signing",
      "title": "Signing and verifying an IRIS CDN release",
      "description": "How an IRIS CDN release is packaged, signed and verified using published standards only: a BagIt bag (RFC 8493), a detached JWS (RFC 7515 App. F) with ES256 (RFC 7518), and the key published in a did:web DID document whose publicKeyJwk carries an x5c chain up to WHO's signing key. No GDHCN trust list is assumed.",
